{"page":157,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:52","surah":7,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ جِئْنَـٰهُم بِكِتَـٰبٍ فَصَّلْنَـٰهُ عَلَىٰ عِلْمٍ هُدًى وَرَحْمَةً لِّقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have brought people a Scripture- We have explained it on the basis of true knowledge- as guidance and mercy for those who believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جِئْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"We had brought them","transliteration":"ji'nāhum","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِكِتَـٰبٍۢ","en_gloss":"a Book","transliteration":"bikitābin","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَصَّلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"which We have explained","transliteration":"faṣṣalnāhu","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِلْمٍ","en_gloss":"knowledge ","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُدًۭى","en_gloss":"as guidance","transliteration":"hudan","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"and mercy","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"who believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"7:52"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٥٢","en_gloss":"(52)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:52"}]},{"verse_key":"7:53","surah":7,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"هَلْ يَنظُرُونَ إِلَّا تَأْوِيلَهُۥ ۚ يَوْمَ يَأْتِى تَأْوِيلُهُۥ يَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ نَسُوهُ مِن قَبْلُ قَدْ جَآءَتْ رُسُلُ رَبِّنَا بِٱلْحَقِّ فَهَل لَّنَا مِن شُفَعَآءَ فَيَشْفَعُوا۟ لَنَآ أَوْ نُرَدُّ فَنَعْمَلَ غَيْرَ ٱلَّذِى كُنَّا نَعْمَلُ ۚ قَدْ خَسِرُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَهُمْ وَضَلَّ عَنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ يَفْتَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"What are they waiting for but the fulfilment of its [final prophecy]? On the Day it is fulfilled, those who had ignored it will say, ‘Our Lord’s messenger spoke the truth. Is there anyone to intercede for us now? Or can we be sent back to behave differently from the way we behaved before?’ They will really have squandered their souls, and all [the idols] they invented will have deserted them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Do","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they wait","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَأْوِيلَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"(for) its fulfillment","transliteration":"tawīlahu","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَأْتِى","en_gloss":"(will) come","transliteration":"yatī","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَأْوِيلُهُۥ","en_gloss":"its fulfillment","transliteration":"tawīluhu","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"will say","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَسُوهُ","en_gloss":"had forgotten it","transliteration":"nasūhu","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":14,"ar":"جَآءَتْ","en_gloss":"had come","transliteration":"jāat","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رُسُلُ","en_gloss":"(the) Messengers","transliteration":"rusulu","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رَبِّنَا","en_gloss":"(of) our Lord","transliteration":"rabbinā","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"with the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَهَل","en_gloss":"so are (there)","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"7:53"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَّنَا",